WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Welcome to the automata theory lecture.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:12.000
Today we prove that a to the n b to the n is not regular using the pumping lemma.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Assume for contradiction that the language is regular and let p be the pumping length.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Choose the string w equal to a to the p b to the p, which is longer than p.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Any split of w into xyz must place y entirely in the a block.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:22.000
Pumping down then yields fewer a symbols than b symbols, so the result is not in the language.
